#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-flight-modes.rst:4
#: db67df9ca1134353bd18c56088d088de
msgid "QuadPlane Flight modes"
msgstr "QuadPlane 飞行模式"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-flight-modes.rst:6
#: 3761e3f9ad9640bf9abf5ef603361ba7
msgid ""
"The QuadPlane code is based upon the Plane master firmware but with 6 extra "
"modes. Most are identical to equivalent Copter modes:"
msgstr "QuadPlane 代码基于 Plane 主固件，但额外增加了6种模式，大多数与等效的 Copter 模式相同："

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-flight-modes.rst:24
#: f1e9a8943f8e48ea97415bbaee29b4b6
msgid ""
"** not actually a flight mode, but rather a feature of QACRO and QSTABILIZE"
msgstr "** 并非真正的飞行模式，而是 QACRO 和 QSTABILIZE 的一种功能特性。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-flight-modes.rst:26
#: 9d88f911812e4da19151d23d4fcd4c76
msgid "\\*\\*\\* not actually a flight mode, but a VTOL tuning feature"
msgstr "\\*\\*\\* 并非真正的飞行模式，而是一种 VTOL 调参功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-flight-modes.rst:28
#: 92fff0bc5a5940b1a049687d086a8979
msgid ""
"\\*\\*\\*\\* not actually a flight mode, but a VTOL tuning and model "
"development tool"
msgstr "\\*\\*\\*\\* 并非真正的飞行模式，而是一种 VTOL 调参和模型开发工具。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-flight-modes.rst:30
#: 93424ec284064a7cb361324481126ff5
msgid ""
"RTL mode can behave differently than a normal fixed wing RTL, depending on "
"the setting of the :ref:`Q_RTL_MODE<Q_RTL_MODE>` parameter. See :ref:`Hybrid"
" RTLs <hybrid_rtl>`."
msgstr ""
"RTL 模式的行为可能与普通固定翼 RTL 不同，具体取决于 :ref:`Q_RTL_MODE<Q_RTL_MODE>` 参数的设置。详见 "
":ref:`混合 RTL <hybrid_rtl>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-flight-modes.rst:33
#: 3f27e6c12c8148c0bf340db5a4d73e4b
msgid ""
"You may need to set the ``FLTMODE*`` parameters for these extra modes as "
"numeric values if your GCS doesn't understand these values yet."
msgstr "如果您的 GCS 尚不支持这些额外模式的枚举值，可能需要将 ``FLTMODE*`` 参数设为数值形式。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-flight-modes.rst:37
#: b627fccd0e484e55816eb7499d8b0e7e
msgid ""
"If you are familiar with the equivalent Copter flight modes then you should "
"be comfortable flying a QuadPlane. The most significant difference comes "
"during transition between fixed wing and QuadPlane flight, which is "
"described :ref:`here <quadplane-flying>`."
msgstr ""
"如果您熟悉等效的 Copter 飞行模式，那么飞行 QuadPlane 应该会比较得心应手。最显著的区别在于固定翼飞行与 QuadPlane "
"飞行之间的切换，相关说明在 :ref:`此处 <quadplane-flying>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-flight-modes.rst:44
#: 12882dd16caa49e08f89c26281567133
msgid ""
"There is also a difference in throttle channel parameters from Copter: "
"instead of :ref:`THR_DZ<THR_DZ>` for setting the deadzone, QuadPlane uses "
"RCn_DZ (where n is the channel mapped to throttle input). The default for "
"throttle channel deadzone is 60 (+/- 6%). If your QuadPlane does not hover "
"at mid-stick (+/- 6%) in QSTABILIZE, you will need to center it using "
":ref:`Q_M_THST_HOVER<Q_M_THST_HOVER>` to set the throttle percentage applied"
" at mid-stick in QSTABILIZE such that switching to QHOVER or QLOITER does "
"not result in an altitude change. This value can be automatically learned "
"and applied during QLOITER and QHOVER modes, by enabling "
":ref:`Q_M_HOVER_LEARN<Q_M_HOVER_LEARN>`."
msgstr ""
"油门通道参数与 Copter 也有所不同：QuadPlane 使用 RCn_DZ（其中 n 为映射到油门输入的通道）来设置死区，而非 "
":ref:`THR_DZ<THR_DZ>`。油门通道死区的默认值为60（±6%）。如果您的 QuadPlane 在 QSTABILIZE "
"模式下无法在中位油门（±6%）悬停，您需要使用 :ref:`Q_M_THST_HOVER<Q_M_THST_HOVER>` 来设置 QSTABILIZE"
" 模式下中位油门时施加的油门百分比，使切换到 QHOVER 或 QLOITER 时不会引起高度变化。该值可在 QLOITER 和 QHOVER "
"模式中通过启用 :ref:`Q_M_HOVER_LEARN<Q_M_HOVER_LEARN>` 自动学习并应用。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-flight-modes.rst:50
#: 9e3b96df984e47cf97b88c2f9465cc39
msgid ""
"Since QuadPlanes have much higher surface area than most Copters, hovering "
"or loitering in a tail wind can be a challenge for stability. It is "
"generally better to hover or loiter with the nose pointed into the wind, see"
" :ref:`Weathervaning <quadplane-weathervaning>`."
msgstr ""
"由于 QuadPlane 的表面积远大于大多数多旋翼飞机，在顺风中悬停或盘旋对稳定性是一个挑战。通常最好将机头迎风悬停或盘旋，详见 "
":ref:`风向标效应 <quadplane-weathervaning>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-flight-modes.rst:54
#: dc59eb97cf36485daab66ebe4cf1116d
msgid ""
"The landing detection logic in QLOITER mode is not as sophisticated as the "
"landing detection logic in Copter, so if you get GPS movement while on the "
"ground in QLOITER mode then the aircraft may try to tip over as it tries to "
"hold position while in contact with the ground. It is suggested that you "
"switch to QHOVER or QSTABILIZE once landed as these are unaffected by GPS "
"movement."
msgstr ""
"QLOITER 模式中的降落检测逻辑不如 Copter 中的逻辑完善，因此如果在地面上处于 QLOITER 模式时出现 GPS "
"移动，飞机可能会在与地面接触的同时尝试保持位置而导致倾翻。建议降落后切换到 QHOVER 或 QSTABILIZE，因为这两种模式不受 GPS "
"移动的影响。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-flight-modes.rst:58
#: fe000597a46d4126805e019738eb5b5a
msgid "Flight modes to avoid"
msgstr "应避免使用的飞行模式"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-flight-modes.rst:60
#: 3fabf122e9ef4784bd10b447067be371
msgid ""
"The linked nature of the vertical lift and fixed wing control in quadplanes "
"means the autopilot always needs to know what the pilot is trying to do in "
"terms of speed and attitude. For this reason you should avoid the following "
"flight modes in a quadplane:"
msgstr ""
"quadplane 中垂直升力与固定翼控制的关联性意味着飞控需要始终了解飞手在速度和姿态方面的意图。因此，在 quadplane "
"中应避免使用以下飞行模式："

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-flight-modes.rst:63
#: 6ebed11661e8458f8172be51c7c45b08
msgid "ACRO"
msgstr "ACRO"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-flight-modes.rst:64
#: b60facae09cc47309ce9fc067d6096e1
msgid "STABILIZE"
msgstr "STABILIZE"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-flight-modes.rst:65
#: b9542d02a2f842f1ad52fa4034c85ce7
msgid "TRAINING"
msgstr "TRAINING"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-flight-modes.rst:67
#: 47738707c6e94d1895e353c1b9a0f769
msgid ""
"these modes are problematic as the stick input from the pilot is not "
"sufficient to tell the autopilot what attitude the aircraft wants or what "
"climb rate is wanted, so the quadplane logic does not engage the quad motors"
" when in these modes. These modes also make log analysis difficult. Please "
"use FBWA mode instead of STABILIZE for manual flight."
msgstr ""
"这些模式存在问题，因为飞手的摇杆输入不足以告知飞控飞机所需的姿态或爬升率，因此 quadplane "
"逻辑在这些模式下不会启动四旋翼电机。这些模式也使日志分析变得困难。手动飞行时，请使用 FBWA 模式代替 STABILIZE。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-flight-modes.rst:70
#: 0e11f10ee9864277841b54c84f1d207a
msgid ""
"In the future we may add ways to use the quad motors in these modes, but for"
" now please avoid them."
msgstr "未来我们可能会增加在这些模式下使用四旋翼电机的方法，但目前请避免使用它们。"

#: ../../source/docs/quadplane-flight-modes.rst:72
#: 2ef48531eea64a2b974635b73d43f5a1
msgid ""
"The other mode where the quad motors are disabled is MANUAL mode. That mode "
"still can be useful for checking aircraft trim in fixed wing flight or for "
"taxiing your aircraft."
msgstr "另一个禁用四旋翼电机的模式是 MANUAL 模式。该模式仍可用于检查固定翼飞行中的飞机配平或滑行。"
